<title>UK: Bank Julius Baer sets warrants on Danzas Holding.</title>
<headline>Bank Julius Baer sets warrants on Danzas Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Julius Baer &amp; Co said ithas issued 400,000 American-style call warrants on Danzas Holdings.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1300 CHF		  PREMIUM	14.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     19.0 CHF		  GEARING	6.8 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.SEP.96-15.DEC.97   PAYDATE	20.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS STOCK EXCHANGE</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
